"Passion, and Path."

00:31:36.430 --> 00:31:38.540
They'll need a new
business, and a new passion,

00:31:38.540 --> 00:31:41.430
because their QAnon purpose was a lie.

00:31:41.430 --> 00:31:42.710
And since they were all dumb enough

00:31:42.710 --> 00:31:44.760
to livestream themselves
